# 118-construction-reference-parallel: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# construction-reference-parallel: Fixed construction line (0,40)-(30,55) (slope 1/2); quad A(10,5) B(50,5) C(50,35) fixed, D drawn (12,22); DA vertical and CD parallel to the construction line put D at (10,15): area 800; extruded 10.
{"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"origin": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "normal": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], "x": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]}}
{"cmd": "sketch.line", "points": [[0, 40], [30, 55]]}
